{"2941790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tour de Farm", "steam_appid": 2941790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tour de Farm is a Vehicle Racing and Adventure Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the real life Cook's Farm in the north west USA, Tour de Farm invites you to drive in on and off road adventures, from racing to exploring, to farm activities and wacky destruction derbies! It's a fun virtual day out for all the family! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/c5833939757218506f1616ba9b7769f4.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/c5833939757218506f1616ba9b7769f4.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Off Road Racing</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race around the farm's dirt tracks in time trails! Get those tires dirty as you round up the hogs! Head off road and into the scenic countryside to complete objectives against the clock!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/f6e0ff68446b3ef0d5591fcc473ccb37.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/f6e0ff68446b3ef0d5591fcc473ccb37.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Vehicle Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your vehicle of choice from the farm itself and out into the Snoqualmie Valley to visit it's fantastic landmarks such as: The town of Duvall, the city of Redmond and experience visiting Carnation as the sun rises over the hills. Explore a vast and beautiful open world! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/c0a42695cb5032e6867dc9c47c43d537.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/c0a42695cb5032e6867dc9c47c43d537.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Campaign Storyline </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just sit there! There's work to be done on the farm and supplies to be collected to keep the business running! <br>Get fuel from the Gas Station! Round up the escaped pigs! Drive the truck to get water from Stillwater! Chat to Dan, the farm's owner, and learn more about everything to do on Cook's Farm! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/d1d7d8a84cc0e0cb2e5d6d8d354b5323.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/d1d7d8a84cc0e0cb2e5d6d8d354b5323.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Multiple Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who wants to just drive cars?! There are up to 15 vehicles available to pilot both around and beyond the farm. From trucks to tractors, quads and bikes, and our own personal favorite: The Floodmobile! (pictured above)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/de765a1d76c4ddf176ed4645dbbfb30e.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/de765a1d76c4ddf176ed4645dbbfb30e.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tour de Farm is based on the real life exciting activities and adventures that take place on Cook's Farm in the Snoqualmie Valley, in Washington State, USA.  Dan, the farm owner, runs a real farm that hosts driving events and in the game you get to experience that fun for the first time in a video game!  <br><br>So what are ya waiting for?! Join us for a drive, a race and many amazing adventures in this one of a kind driving experience!   </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tour de Farm is a Vehicle Racing and Adventure Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the real life Cook's Farm in the north west USA, Tour de Farm invites you to drive in on and off road adventures, from racing to exploring, to farm activities and wacky destruction derbies! It's a fun virtual day out for all the family! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/c5833939757218506f1616ba9b7769f4.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/c5833939757218506f1616ba9b7769f4.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Off Road Racing</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race around the farm's dirt tracks in time trails! Get those tires dirty as you round up the hogs! Head off road and into the scenic countryside to complete objectives against the clock!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/f6e0ff68446b3ef0d5591fcc473ccb37.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/f6e0ff68446b3ef0d5591fcc473ccb37.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Vehicle Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your vehicle of choice from the farm itself and out into the Snoqualmie Valley to visit it's fantastic landmarks such as: The town of Duvall, the city of Redmond and experience visiting Carnation as the sun rises over the hills. Explore a vast and beautiful open world! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/c0a42695cb5032e6867dc9c47c43d537.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/c0a42695cb5032e6867dc9c47c43d537.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Campaign Storyline </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just sit there! There's work to be done on the farm and supplies to be collected to keep the business running! <br>Get fuel from the Gas Station! Round up the escaped pigs! Drive the truck to get water from Stillwater! Chat to Dan, the farm's owner, and learn more about everything to do on Cook's Farm! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/d1d7d8a84cc0e0cb2e5d6d8d354b5323.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/d1d7d8a84cc0e0cb2e5d6d8d354b5323.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span><strong>Multiple Vehicles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who wants to just drive cars?! There are up to 15 vehicles available to pilot both around and beyond the farm. From trucks to tractors, quads and bikes, and our own personal favorite: The Floodmobile! (pictured above)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras/de765a1d76c4ddf176ed4645dbbfb30e.avif?t=1776016800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/extras_big/de765a1d76c4ddf176ed4645dbbfb30e.webp?t=1776016800 width=1560 height=723 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tour de Farm is based on the real life exciting activities and adventures that take place on Cook's Farm in the Snoqualmie Valley, in Washington State, USA.  Dan, the farm owner, runs a real farm that hosts driving events and in the game you get to experience that fun for the first time in a video game!  <br><br>So what are ya waiting for?! Join us for a drive, a race and many amazing adventures in this one of a kind driving experience!   </p>", "short_description": "Come down to Cook's Farm and race to your heart's content. Meet the farm owner Dan Cook and compete in off road racing to unlock outrageous vehicles. Hit the road to explore the Snoqualmie Valley in all it's picturesque beauty and engage in wacky races as you Tour De Farm!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/810fede166546fa2bb22b7d836718a302ef3ff11/header.jpg?t=1776016800", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/ae450cc92b05fedccf2cfb1c14fc005034b66349/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776016800", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941790/ae450cc92b05fedccf2cfb1c14fc005034b66349/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776016800", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6300 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970 or Radeon RX 580 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</